%% Logical Data Diagram — vendor-neutral components and kinds.
%% Syntax: Mermaid flowchart (MIT): https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
%% No folders, jobs, or Bronze/Silver/Gold.

flowchart LR
    subgraph vocab [Reference vocabulary]
        currency[Currency master]
        indicator[Indicator master]
        impact[Impact class reference]
    end

    subgraph occurrence [Release occurrence]
        event[Calendar release event]
        reading[Reading attributes]
    end

    subgraph products [Projections]
        attention[Operator attention analytical]
        star[Analytical occurrence]
    end

    currency -->|classifies| event
    indicator -->|classifies| event
    impact -->|classifies| event
    event --> reading
    event -->|lossy filter and operator clock| attention
    event -->|full grain dimensions| star
